      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This policy change (30 days) for VRC+ users was announced in [Developer Update - December 18 2025](https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-december-18-2025/47354) to be upcoming in January 2026 and according to a VRChat Wiki [diff 60721](https://wiki.vrchat.com/index.php?title=VRC%2B&diff=prev&oldid=60721) has been live for a few days (31 January 2026). There was no patch note about this policy change or new feature in [VRChat 2026.1.1](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202611) (January 27, 2026) or [VRChat 2026.1.1p1](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/copy-of-vrchat-202611) (February 2, 2026) patch notes, unlike how favorite worlds slots were mentioned in both the patch notes and developer update.",
