  "details": "https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500002248601-I-d-like-to-change-my-name\n\nAt the top it says:\n\n> Changing your display name can be done at most once per 90 days. This policy may change at any time with no notification. [...]\n\nThen there's an outdated screenshot showing a Support Agent with a tip that the reader may never get their original name back, and the display name may only be changed \"every 3 months\"; this tip is absent from the live version.\n\nAnd below it says:\n\n> You may only change your display name once per 90 days.\n\nAnd below that:\n\n> Again, please remember that you may only change your name once in 90 days. This limit cannot be overridden, so be careful when changing your name!\n\nI'm looking at my [Account Settings](https://vrchat.com/home/profile) at VRChat Home website as a VRC+ subscriber, and it tells me I can change my name once per 30 days, instead of 90 days.\n\nThe information about 30 days should probably be added or changed in that Help Desk article.",
